    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">First Session is a first-person horror game set in a world where virtual drugs are used to escape reality. It combines psychological horror, RPG-style dialogues, and narrative exploration.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a virtual drug addict, evolving between the city of Eleftheria and digital universes. In this <strong>narrative-focused</strong> experience, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete missions</strong> to buy your next dose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build </strong>a strong <strong>relationship </strong>with your AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to <strong>survive </strong>with the mysterious creator of Wild Dose</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER FOUR UNIVERSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379270/extras/194258e9e78cd3c51e1257a7265cba21.poster.avif?t=1754037336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379270/extras/194258e9e78cd3c51e1257a7265cba21.webm?t=1754037336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379270/extras/194258e9e78cd3c51e1257a7265cba21.mp4?t=1754037336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Walk the streets of Eleftheria, a hub for your virtual sessions, and fulfill contracts to buy your next dose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get away with your AI in Fresh Air, the legal virtual drug, and choose to build a strong relationship with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Wild Dose with the Capetian, the mysterious creator of that drug, and learn to survive in this dangerous universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of the Void, an unstable virtual space, made of unallocated memory segments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Session blends <strong>RPG</strong>, <strong>psychological horror</strong> elements, and <strong>narrative exploration</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore four universes with varied atmospheres and game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rely on a roleplay-oriented dialogue system to build your own adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy an immersive original soundtrack by Kevin Colombin</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
