of unallocated memory segments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Session blends <strong>RPG</strong>, <strong>psychological horror</strong> elements, and <strong>narrative exploration</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore four universes with varied atmospheres and game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rely on a roleplay-oriented dialogue system to build your own adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy an immersive original soundtrack by Kevin Colombin</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
